Scope of this repository
------------------------

This repository contains the generic automation bridge and the runtime it
drives:

* the Scriptd service runtime, supervisor, and control API;
* the module implementations (Brew Manager, CPU Monitor, Wi-Fi Monitor, and
  Router Watch);
* the privilege broker, its authorization policy, and its audit trail;
* the `scriptd-bridge-protocol` crate of shared wire types; and
* a browser-based control center retained as a generic fallback.

The paid desktop product, its interface, and its product-specific rules,
scheduling, and presets are developed separately and are not part of this
repository. Nothing from that product may be copied into this repository or
into a release archive published from it.
